## The brief

A local electrician in Merthyr Tydfil needed a professional online presence quickly and affordably — something that would rank on Google, look the part, and generate enquiries without a large upfront cost.

## What we built

A fully managed website under our Managed Starter Website service. The site covers all core electrical services — domestic, commercial, inspection, and emergency call-outs — with dedicated service pages, an areas we serve section, and clear calls to action throughout.

Built on a fast, SEO-ready foundation with domain and hosting included, the site was live within days of the brief being agreed.

